"""
train_maskrcnn_detfuse_single_1to3.py  (FIXED bbox degeneracy)

Airbus Ship Detection — Single-GPU (NO DDP) Mask R-CNN training with detector-assisted sampling, phased training:
Phase1 -> Phase2 -> Phase3(multiscale) ALL-IN-ONE.

✅ Requirements preserved:
- Single GPU only (no torchrun/DDP/DistributedSampler).
- Phased training with early stopping per phase.
- Robust integrity scan (PIL decode) + cache.
- FP32 only (no AMP).
- NaN/Inf guard.
- Detector probability CSV outputs (train + test template ids) if detector_ckpt provided.
- Stratified sampling by pos:neg ratio (pos_frac or pos_neg_ratio).
- Optional detector-prioritized pool before stratified sampling.
- Outputs (global/detail logs, splits/config/summary JSON).
- Each phase saves model checkpoints separately:
    phase1/best_model.pt, phase1/last_model.pt
    phase2/best_model.pt, phase2/last_model.pt
    phase3_multiscale/best_model.pt, phase3_multiscale/last_model.pt

🔧 FIX (CRITICAL):
- Ensure bounding boxes always have positive height/width:
  Use exclusive max coords (x2 = xmax + 1, y2 = ymax + 1) and clamp to image size.
  Also enforce x2 > x1 and y2 > y1 after clamping.

Dataset layout under --data_dir:
  train_v2/
  test_v2/
  train_ship_segmentations_v2.csv
  sample_submission_v2.csv
"""

